egory_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"xpJm4Kt6ItAm8PGYBlIezQ","review_id":"JRBFxzADjISNVwmYNdNC1g","date":"2016-10-11T19:42:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9310434460639954,"text_excerpt":"I don't know of anywhere in the entirety of Orleans Parish where you can get an overloaded small shrimp poboy and fries for $4.99. Hell, you can't get a meal at McDonald's for that price anymore. They also serve some delicious fried rice and oysters too. In fact, everything I've tried here is pretty darn good. They are also super quick with their orders. This review is making me hungry. Excuse the shortness of it while I go get me a shrimp poboy from here."},{"business_id":"xpJm4Kt6ItAm8PGYBlIezQ","review_id":"kwdblDCYkjrhw0fXsty3ug","date":"2018-12-04T13:04:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9277002811431885,"text_excerpt":"I've seen this place so many times but only came by when I started working in this area. I ordered a shrimp on bun combo. It was a pretty big bun and plenty of shrimp. It's a drive thru with a walk up as well and it's fast fast food. Will definitely be back very soon to try the wings and burgers."},{"business_id":"xpJm4Kt6ItAm8PGYBlIezQ","review_id":"nC_VjsERAkfx9vJOj152AQ","date":"2021-08-26T00:24:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9243300557136536,"text_excerpt":"This place is a hidden gem in New Orleans East. Tasty food at reasonable prices. I get a meal from here at least once a week. I haven't had any food from here that I didn't enjoy but my absolute favorite is the PoBoy cheeseburger dressed. It's so filling and good for only $6! You get 2 patties on 12 inch poboy bread, you can't bet that. Customer service is always top notch and I love that they have a drive through so I never have to get out my car. They have a wide variety of food and desserts. They even have snow balls. Located on Read Blvd in New Orleans East."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xpJm4Kt6ItAm8PGYBlIezQ","photo_id":"lSHfOXDG9ZMq1w3ZwzgMZQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/lSHfOXDG9ZMq1w3ZwzgMZQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
